Here is the commit message:
LUCENE-7340: MemoryIndex.toString renamed to toStringDebug;
 fix NPE

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by the `toString()` method in the `MemoryIndex` class potentially accessing null references, which could lead to a NullPointerException (NPE) when attempting to construct a string representation of the index data. This was particularly problematic when handling payloads, as the method did not adequately check for null values before attempting to read or append them to the result string.

Here is the patch:
